    "physical_model": "Sum of split (asymmetric) pseudo-Voigt profiles, one per Bragg reflection, on a SNIP background (snip_iterations='auto'). eta (Gaussian-Lorentzian mixing) free per peak in [0,1]. Expected ~7\u20139 significant reflections: ~11.0\u00b0, ~17.7\u00b0, ~18.6\u00b0, ~19.2\u00b0 (weak), ~22.2\u00b0 (strong), ~24.6\u00b0 (weak/borderline), ~26.0\u00b0 (broad), ~29.5\u00b0, plus weaker high-angle features. Peaks within 1.5\u00d7FWHM (the 17.7/18.6/19.2 cluster) are fit jointly within the single global model.",
